  **Acceptance criteria:**
  - Each Monday run sends one alert email listing every item at or below its reorder point.
  - The run reads stock without writing to it.
  **Executor:** GitHub Actions
  **Diagram:**
  ```flowchart
  flowchart TB
    P["GitHub Actions"] -->|Read items at or below reorder point| T1["Northwind Order Service"]
    P -->|Send restock alert email| T2["Store mail service"]
